cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RestoreCheck: Automated Backup Recoverability Verification and Disaster-Recovery Testing on AWS"
abstract: >-
  A serverless AWS system that regularly restores the newest Amazon RDS for
  PostgreSQL snapshot into a temporary instance, verifies the restored data with
  six integrity checks, records and alerts on the result, and always deletes
  the temporary instance.
